Subject: [PATCH] feat(work-suspension): CRUD, preview and active-per-date
 check

- PATCH /v1/work-suspension/:id, DELETE /v1/work-suspension/:id (archived/LEGACY read-only -> 409)
- GET /v1/work-suspension?from&to&includeArchived
- GET /v1/work-suspension/preview?suspensionType&suspensionStartTime -> minutes, f, ND per schedule
- one active suspension per date (409), TIME_OF_DAY requires a start time (422), LEGACY cannot be created (400)
- local ValidationPipe (global pipe is disabled); whitelist drops app: 'ems'
- removed GET asdasdasd test endpoint
- getWorkSuspensionBySuspensionDate only reads LEGACY hours and no longer swallows errors
- unit tests

